# --- Overlay files (personal data; .example versions are tracked) ---
.env
scrub-patterns.txt
Meta/brain.md
.wulong/projects.json
# keep .example templates tracked
!.env.example
!scrub-patterns.txt.example
!Meta/brain.md.example
!.wulong/projects.json.example

# --- Payload re-materialised by `wulong init .` at the repo root ---
# The tracked source of the agent payload is wulong/payload/. Running init here
# (which CI and the test suite both do, because vault-health-check.py raises if
# CLAUDE.md is absent) writes 69 of those files back to the repo root as
# untracked duplicates. Staging them by accident would silently restore the
# double-copy that Change C1 removed.
/CLAUDE.md
/.claude/

